# Course materials and exemplar reports supplied for guidance (thesis-guidance/):
# ~101MB of third-party PDFs including other students' dissertations, plus the
# 60MB muthesis example archive. Reference material, not this project's work, and
# not ours to redistribute.
thesis-guidance/

# Fusion21 client documents. Commercially sensitive, and the report's AI statement
# explicitly says they are not reproduced. Keep them locally, never commit them.
# "Documents by F21/" was committed and pushed to the public repo on 2026-08-15 by
# mistake; history was rewritten with git-filter-repo on 2026-09-11 to remove it
# retroactively (backup bundle: ../repo-backup-pre-rewrite/). This entry is what
# stops it happening again.
award letter.docx
pretend data.pdf
Documents by F21/

# Build artefacts regenerable from the .tex sources
thesis*/*.zip
thesis*/thesis-v4-final.zip
